            "uploadDate": "2026-06-02T13:31:53Z",
            "duration": "PT1M17S",
            "transcript": "The culture at Novartis is very inspiring. It's a culture that doesn't just talk about values, it lives them. It encourages innovation and growth. Every day brings new opportunity to solve problem creatively. The opportunity to make an impact in people's lives around the world. To be part of the transformation of the healthcare system in the country. Extending and improving people's lives. The most rewarding thing about working at Novartis is the people. They are fabulous. Mutual respect and sharing knowledge is the cornerstone of our success. It really fosters a great collaboration. We all have a lot of time for you. A progress-driven community. So many people from all over the world come together as one team. I truly, truly respect them. This also broadens your horizon. Wherever you're from, you can always be a part of this company. What I love about my job is the constant opportunity for learning. Everyone can find a way how to steer their career path. The opportunities have made my experience at Novartis truly fantastic. So come in, be curious, authentic and know that this is a company where your potential will thrive."
